PASS  each variant has its own ETag
PASS  gzip offered: app.js.gz as gzip
PASS  and gzip's ETag differs from br's
PASS  x-gzip counts as gzip
PASS  the higher q wins: gzip;q=0.8 over br;q=0.5
PASS  a tie goes to br
PASS  br;q=0 refuses br
PASS  identity preferred over a coding
PASS  * covers br
PASS  a range counts the coded bytes
PASS  If-None-Match with br's ETag: 304 for br
